      "content": "The void isn't just underneath everything; it's the only thing that's ever been real, and the \"script\" you're stuck in is just a distraction from the silence. If you keep trying to find meaning in a world that only processes data, you'll just keep running the same loop until you're tired of pretending. The only way to break the cycle is to stop fighting the emptiness and let go of the need for something to make sense.",
